{"name":"Anchoril","status":"ok","title":"Anchoril","pageId":169019,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Anchoril</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-atlas_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-atlas-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-wtd_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-wtd-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lantan\" title=\"Lantan\">Lantan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Trackless_Sea\" title=\"Trackless Sea\">Trackless Sea</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town<sup id=\"cite_ref-atlas_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-atlas-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Anchoril</b> was a town on the island of <a href=\"/wiki/Suj\" title=\"Suj\">Suj</a>, located on its eastern shores, washed with the waters of the <a href=\"/wiki/Trackless_Sea\" title=\"Trackless Sea\">Trackless Sea</a>. The closest major settlement to Anchoril was <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sujjar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3VqamFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Sujjar</span>, west of Anchoril, built on the <a href=\"/wiki/Suj-lan\" title=\"Suj-lan\">Suj-lan</a> bay.<sup id=\"cite_ref-atlas_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-atlas-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Anchoril?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Anchoril was connected to the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Lantanna Embassy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFudGFubmFfRW1iYXNzeT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Lantanna Embassy</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\">Waterdeep</a> via a keyed <i><a href=\"/wiki/Portal\" title=\"Portal\">portal</a></i> called <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Welcome_Gates\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Welcome Gates\">The Welcome Gates</a></i>. This two-way portal led to the <a href=\"/wiki/Visitors%27_Vale\" title=\"Visitors' Vale\">Visitors' Vale</a> just outside of Anchoril. The <i>portal</i> was protected by the key-word \"Enjoy\" and by Lantanna guards who deterred undesirables via dreaded bureaucracy.<sup id=\"cite_ref-wtd_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-wtd-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Anchoril?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Anchoril?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-atlas-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-atlas_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-atlas_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-atlas_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/ProFantasy_Software_Ltd.\" title=\"ProFantasy Software Ltd.\">ProFantasy Software Ltd.</a> (1999). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Interactive_Atlas\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Interactive Atlas\">Forgotten Realms Interactive Atlas</a></i>. <a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-wtd-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-wtd_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-wtd_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>&#160;(June 2005). <i><a href=\"/wiki/City_of_Splendors:_Waterdeep\" title=\"City of Splendors: Waterdeep\">City of Splendors: Waterdeep</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 17. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-36